<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3548/53  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.6820/25  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.8878/88  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4476/86  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     34.71/72   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.6798/18  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1652.5/3.5 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     124.09/19  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.3796/46  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.6258/78  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4115/35  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4174/84  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7676/81  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7485/95  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6321/33</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$343.35/343.75</p>
</text>
